          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweedida, ghang'eada eenda Furati ea ghwahita moonghooda Misri NG'UTAMIIDA gayghwalach boagaaschi, ak agooga gajeeliimuunaneegwa, Ea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida gajeaghuut durumbeateeda haw, ak fuga Israeli roosa ng'eanyiida Ashuru, ea gea darsa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri gaygabiigu ghabwat NG'UTAMIIDA aba giijeeda ghaydit aba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
